<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>HTML Lists Activity</title>
</head>
<body>

    <h2>My Favorite Fruits (Unordered List)</h2>
    <!-- Unordered lists use the <ul> tag, and items use the <li> tag -->
    <ul>
        <li>Apple</li>
        <li>Mango</li>
        <li>Banana</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Steps to Make Tea (Ordered List)</h2>
    <!-- Ordered lists use the <ol> tag, and items use the <li> tag -->
    <ol>
        <li>Boil water in a pan.</li>
        <li>Add tea leaves and sugar.</li>
        <li>Add milk and bring to a boil.</li>
        <li>Serve hot!</li>
    </ol>

</body>
</html>
